• Lingulodinium polyedra is a marine dinoflagellate species that emits brief blue light flashes when mechanically agitated.
• Laboratory shear-flow experiments show that a single cell flash lasts approximately 100 milliseconds at 475 nanometers wavelength.
• When grazing copepods disturb the water, the resulting flashes startle the copepods and reduce their feeding rates by 55%.
• The flashes also illuminate the copepods, making them visible to nocturnal predatory fish from up to two meters away.
• Cultures kept under constant light lose their circadian bioluminescence rhythm within four days.', 'The student wants to explain how bioluminescence protects Lingulodinium polyedra in two distinct ways. Which choice most effectively uses relevant information from the notes to accomplish this goal?', '[{"id": "A", "text": "Lingulodinium polyedra emits 100-millisecond flashes at a wavelength of 475 nanometers when mechanically agitated."}, {"id": "B", "text": "When disturbed by grazing copepods, Lingulodinium polyedra emits blue flashes that both directly startle the copepods—cutting feeding by 55%—and expose the grazers to nocturnal predatory fish."}, {"id": "C", "text": "Nocturnal predatory fish can spot illuminated prey from distances of up to two meters in dark water."}, {"id": "D", "text": "Laboratory cultures of Lingulodinium polyedra lose their circadian rhythm if kept under constant illumination for four days."}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hdsat-open-core-2026', 'HDSAT Open Core Curated Bank', 'CC-BY-4.0', 'HDSAT Open Core Curated Bank (CC-BY-4.0)', FALSE, 'active') ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET external_id = EXCLUDED.external_id, assessments = EXCLUDED.assessments, section = EXCLUDED.section, domain = EXCLUDED.domain, skill = EXCLUDED.skill, difficulty = EXCLUDED.difficulty, format = EXCLUDED.format, stimulus = EXCLUDED.stimulus, prompt = EXCLUDED.prompt, choices = EXCLUDED.choices, figure_metadata = EXCLUDED.figure_metadata, source_id = EXCLUDED.source_id, source_name = EXCLUDED.source_name, license = EXCLUDED.license, attribution = EXCLUDED.attribution, status = EXCLUDED.status, updated_at = NOW();
