• In 1956, transit planners in Stockholm evaluated replacing central streetcar lines with underground metro tunnels.
• Surface streetcars averaged 14 km/h in mixed downtown traffic during peak winter months.
• The newly excavated Tunnelbana metro lines achieved an average commercial speed of 36 km/h.
• Converting the central corridor reduced cross-city commute times by 42% within the first year of operation.
• Preserved heritage streetcars still operate on a single scenic island line in Djurgården today.', 'The student wants to emphasize the speed advantage of the underground metro over surface streetcars. Which choice most effectively uses relevant information from the notes to accomplish this goal?', '[{"id": "A", "text": "Today, preserved heritage streetcars continue to operate on a scenic island line in Djurgården."}, {"id": "B", "text": "Whereas Stockholm''s surface streetcars averaged 14 km/h in peak traffic, the underground Tunnelbana lines reached 36 km/h, cutting cross-city commute times by 42%."}, {"id": "C", "text": "In 1956, Stockholm transit planners evaluated replacing central streetcar lines with underground tunnels."}, {"id": "D", "text": "Stockholm operates both an underground metro system and a heritage streetcar line."}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hdsat-open-core-2026', 'HDSAT Open Core Curated Bank', 'CC-BY-4.0', 'HDSAT Open Core Curated Bank (CC-BY-4.0)', FALSE, 'active') ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET external_id = EXCLUDED.external_id, assessments = EXCLUDED.assessments, section = EXCLUDED.section, domain = EXCLUDED.domain, skill = EXCLUDED.skill, difficulty = EXCLUDED.difficulty, format = EXCLUDED.format, stimulus = EXCLUDED.stimulus, prompt = EXCLUDED.prompt, choices = EXCLUDED.choices, figure_metadata = EXCLUDED.figure_metadata, source_id = EXCLUDED.source_id, source_name = EXCLUDED.source_name, license = EXCLUDED.license, attribution = EXCLUDED.attribution, status = EXCLUDED.status, updated_at = NOW();
