• This stepped geometry suppresses background low-frequency wind and crowd murmur below 500 Hz.
• At the same time, it reflects high-frequency consonant sounds above 500 Hz toward the upper tiers without amplification.
• Modern reproductions built with smooth concrete steps fail to replicate this selective frequency filtering.', 'The student wants to synthesize the historical scale of the venue with the physical mechanism uncovered by modern researchers. Which choice most effectively uses relevant information from the notes to accomplish this goal?', '[{"id": "A", "text": "To reach all 14,000 spectators in the fourth-century BCE theater at Epidaurus, its 55 corrugated limestone rows function—as Declercq''s team showed—as a diffraction grating that damps noise below 500 Hz and projects vocal frequencies above 500 Hz."}, {"id": "B", "text": "Smooth concrete steps are common in modern theater construction but differ from fourth-century BCE limestone."}, {"id": "C", "text": "Low-frequency wind noise can obscure unamplified performers in large outdoor seating bowls."}, {"id": "D", "text": "Declercq and colleagues studied sound waves above and below 500 Hz in outdoor amphitheaters."}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hdsat-open-core-2026', 'HDSAT Open Core Curated Bank', 'CC-BY-4.0', 'HDSAT Open Core Curated Bank (CC-BY-4.0)', FALSE, 'active') ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET external_id = EXCLUDED.external_id, assessments = EXCLUDED.assessments, section = EXCLUDED.section, domain = EXCLUDED.domain, skill = EXCLUDED.skill, difficulty = EXCLUDED.difficulty, format = EXCLUDED.format, stimulus = EXCLUDED.stimulus, prompt = EXCLUDED.prompt, choices = EXCLUDED.choices, figure_metadata = EXCLUDED.figure_metadata, source_id = EXCLUDED.source_id, source_name = EXCLUDED.source_name, license = EXCLUDED.license, attribution = EXCLUDED.attribution, status = EXCLUDED.status, updated_at = NOW();
